+| POST | `/orgs/{orgID}/users/{uid}/transfer` | `{"toOrgId"}` → 200 `{"id","orgId"}`; org admins of `{orgID}` only |
+
+Transferring a user moves them to the destination organization (which must
+exist, else 400). To keep the model rules, their memberships in the old
+organization's projects are removed, tasks assigned to them are unassigned, and
+the org admin flag is cleared. A path org other than the caller's, or a user not
+in it → 404; a caller who is not an org admin → 403.
+
 Statuses: `open`, `doing`, `done`. Errors are `{"error":"..."}`. Request
 bodies are JSON (`Content-Type: application/json`).
 
